epartment), as well as the average and standard deviation (using STDDEV only and never STDDEV_POP) of the clearing cost collector values for its associated administrative department (including only departments that grant degrees and excluding the Political Science department)? Provide the academic year, department name, variance of total units, standard deviation (using STDDEV only and never STDDEV_POP) of total units, average clearing cost collector, and standard deviation (using STDDEV only and never STDDEV_POP) of clearing cost collector, in that order. Do not return any rounded answers."
